  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV-Vista Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the HIV-Vista project is to support Sub-Saharan African scientists, institutions, and innovative systems of collaboration in designing and testing improved hiv vaccine candidates that will advance the field toward the long-term goal of a safe and globally effective HIV vaccine.</narrative>
  </description>
